if {areas.has_area2_key} == true:
	Leticia: (The lady never told me where we are...)
	join key (Key) center [animation="Fade In Up"]
	Leticia: (But I hope I find answers soon.)
	leave key [animation="Instant Out"]
	key (Default): [Used the Key to open gate.]
	[signal arg="open_area2"]
	[signal arg="take_area2_key"]
	set {areas.has_area2_key} = false
else:
	set {areas.has_interacted_area2_gate} = true
	Leticia: It's locked.